nding transaction is done and now  block 2 if you see has been added the  previous hash value of this block is 0 0  e 9 is the hash value of block 1 another  thing to be noted the value of the  amount in wallet 2 has also got  incremented by 1 dot again we can try  another transaction transferring one  dollar again from wallet 1 to wallet 3 +  C from wallet 2 to wallet 3 I have done  a transaction it is spending can be  mined and block 3s but now what are the  key takeaways today we learned what are  the current issues in the banking system  and how Bitcoin solve them what is  blockchain features of blockchain and a  demo of the features which we have seen  I hope you had a great learning session  and I'll meet you in the next session  thank you  hi there if you like this video  subscribe to the simple learn YouTube  channel and click here to watch similar  videos to nerd up and get certified  click here
 

